# ======================================================================
# DATA POLICY (see docs/ETHICS.md)
#   Raw dream text + user identifiers are S3 and are NEVER committed.
#   Only de-identified aggregates (small CSV/MD) + figures are tracked.
# ======================================================================
10-data/raw/
10-data/external/
10-data/interim/

# user-level PII (userID / name / email / birthdate / sex) — NEVER commit
**/*users_data*.csv
# raw dream text + interpretation + userID (S3) — NEVER commit
**/*dreams_data*.csv

# large binary data artifacts (rebuild from scripts)
*.parquet
*.npz
*.mdb
*.zst
*.tar.xz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.feather

# run/scoring logs (transient)
*.log
